10. Secure Network Communication

Always use HTTPS.

Enable SSL pinning if your app handles sensitive data.

Avoid exposing sensitive headers or logs in production builds.

11. Timeouts and Retry Policy

Configure timeouts properly to prevent freezing.

12. Handle Pagination and Large Data

Use query parameters for pagination.

Show loading indicators at the bottom (in Compose: LazyColumn with LazyPagingItems).

13. Test APIs with MockWebServer

Use MockWebServer for unit testing API responses without hitting real servers.

14. Use Paging3 for Efficient Lists

Combine network + Room with Paging3 to load data smoothly and efficiently.